<h3>Automated Checkpost Clearances</h3>
<p>Traditional manual inspections at state borders and toll plazas can cause delays and expose cargo to unnecessary handling. Automated checkpost clearance systems use RFID tags and QR codes linked to the GPS telematics platform.</p>
